{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isopod</strong> is a roly poly platforming adventure from the wonderful world of <strong>Webbed</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expressive Physics Platforming!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/cef9e77a94d09684b0dbf652498dce8a.poster.avif?t=1761038106\" width=600 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/cef9e77a94d09684b0dbf652498dce8a.webm?t=1761038106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/cef9e77a94d09684b0dbf652498dce8a.mp4?t=1761038106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll up and smash your way through the undergrowth as a bouncy little wrecking ball! The <strong>Fire Ant Conglomerate </strong>won't know what hit 'em!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Magnet Drive!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/2684b48c38852023effbb13f2299714c.poster.avif?t=1761038106\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/2684b48c38852023effbb13f2299714c.webm?t=1761038106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/2684b48c38852023effbb13f2299714c.mp4?t=1761038106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>cool ant</strong> strapped a magnet to your back! Use it to swing through the air, catch flying cannonballs, and zip down powerlines... or just remove heavy metals from the soil - that's an isopod's job after all. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Isopod Skins!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/7804a87f578bdff8480a69ed121c6ebd.poster.avif?t=1761038106\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/7804a87f578bdff8480a69ed121c6ebd.webm?t=1761038106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2053910/extras/7804a87f578bdff8480a69ed121c6ebd.mp4?t=1761038106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find trinkets and trade them for unique shells, both real and fantastical!\u00a0<strong>Be the isopod that you want to be!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Trusting to a Fault","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2053910/541bea438a441706cbc7a7a523b82a315a950b5c.jpg"},{"name":"Flamethrower or Not","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2053910/12d53e3d6b31b9890edb2aa3b325d9fe3fd75590.jpg"},{"name":"Environmental Protection Act 1994","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2053910/53fd2d4b213f411a099e5594e0c11d31fcdcc935.jpg"},{"name":"Resistance Fighter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2053910/07bddc26ddd83a29743713c3ecbb80b8d55bc96f.jpg"},{"name":"Reunited","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2053910/b8da6adddf959f48dbdf33332118663c293901f9.jpg"},{"name":"Row, Row, Row Your Boat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2053910/9784623ca19f289f488677cccf11633d83a2f2e7.jpg"},{"name":"Hero of Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2053910/402caae2e9e7c81aa895a2c53f3bbf